{"id":"vernunft","lemma":"Vernunft","pos":"noun","rank":2873,"glosses":["reason, good sense"],"ipa":"/fɛɐ̯ˈnʊnft/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/9/95/De-Vernunft.ogg/De-Vernunft.ogg.mp3","gender":"f","forms":{"genitive":"Vernunft"},"examples":[{"text":"Er ist eifersüchtig und ohne Vernunft.","en":"He's jealous and irrational.","words":[{"g":"he / it"},{"g":"is","l":"sein"},{"g":"jealous"},{"g":"and"},{"g":"without"},null]},{"text":"Das ist jenseits der Vernunft.","en":"It's beyond reason.","words":[{"g":"the / that"},{"g":"is","l":"sein"},{"g":"beyond"},{"g":"the"},null]},{"text":"Hoffen wir, dass die Vernunft obsiegt.","en":"Let's hope that common sense prevails.","words":[{"g":"to hope"},{"g":"we"},{"g":"that"},{"g":"the"},null,null]},{"text":"Warum willst du nicht auf die Stimme der Vernunft hören?","en":"Why will you not listen to reason?","words":[{"g":"why"},{"g":"to want","l":"wollen"},{"g":"you"},{"g":"not"},{"g":"on"},{"g":"the"},{"g":"voice"},{"g":"the"},null,{"g":"to hear through the ear)"}]},{"text":"Kannst du Tom nicht irgendwie zur Vernunft bringen?","en":"Can't you talk any sense into Tom?","words":[{"g":"can, to be able to","l":"können"},{"g":"you"},null,{"g":"not"},{"g":"somehow"},{"g":"to the"},null,{"g":"to bring"}]}]}